    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Nicely presented three bedroom semi-detached house situated within the Cill Mhuire development ideally located within walking distance of Kenmare town, close to schools, super valu, aldi, lidl and Kenmare medical centre.\r\nAccommodation of 105 sq mts comprises of living room, kitchen/dining room, utility and wc on the ground floor. \r\nThere are three bedrooms (one en-suite) and main bathroom on the first floor.\r\nOFCH throughout the house and open fire in main living room.\r\nSmall private garden area to rear with side entrance."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Ground Floor:\r\n\r\nLiving room: 3.51 M x 5.73 M – open fire, bay window, wood floor\r\n\r\nKitchen/dining room: 3.23 M x 3.82 M – fitted kitchen units, sliding rear door access\r\n\r\nUtility: 1.61 M x 3.33 M – tiled floor, rear door access\r\n\r\nWc: 1.66 M x 1.21 M – fully tiled, wc & whb\r\n\r\nFirst Floor:\r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.03 M x 1.75 M – fully tiled, bath with shower over, wc & whb\r\n\r\nMaster Bedroom: 3.72 M x 3.65 M – carpet floor, built-in wardrobe\r\nEnsuite: 1.34 M x 1.45 M – fully tiled, shower, wc & whb\r\n\r\nBedroom: 2.60 M x 4.36 M – carpet floor, built in wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom: 2.80 M 3.35 M – carpet , built-wardrobe"
      },
